{"id":"rzua9lf1vk599lxyv5qd17fhb","title":"主流Web框架过度信任Forwarded头：揭秘IP与主机名欺骗风险","originalTitle":"Forwarded Without Question: How Web Frameworks Overtrust the Forwarded Header","summary":"某研究团队测试发现，主流Web框架如Rails、Spring Boot默认支持RFC 7239的Forwarded头，而反向代理（如Jetty、Nginx）通常不处理该头，导致IP地址和主机名欺骗风险。建议开发者验证代理与框架配置一致性，优先使用X-Forwarded-*头。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Lobsters 热榜"},"links":{"original":"https://www.lkoskela.fi/blog/2026-11-05-forwarded-without-question/"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-07T06:18:48.419Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-07T12:11:50.184Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-07T12:11:50.184Z","category":"security-privacy","tags":["技术方案","安全漏洞","GitHub"],"score":68,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"github","name":"GitHub"},{"slug":"supply-chain-security","name":"供应链与依赖安全"},{"slug":"security-fix","name":"安全修复与漏洞"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}